# HANGMAN.PDM DGROUP symbols: OFFSET name   (hex, DGROUP-relative)
# Every C-visible original global lives at its original offset (the whole
# original DGROUP is kept in place by tools/pdm2wasm.py), so pointer values
# match the original exactly. Name things here as they get understood;
# the C side declares them in hangman.h.
0EFA g_titleDesc        # title descriptor passed to dm_setAppTitle (self-referencing struct)
0F08 g_spellLoaded      # word: 1 once SPELL resource loaded (init 0000:0072)
AB9E g_cursorHandle     # word: result of dm_initCursor (init 0000:0028)
ABA2 g_windowHandle     # word: passed to dm_initWindow at cleanup (0000:00BF)
0C08 g_defGameDlg       # "Define Game" dialog definition (control state bytes inside)
0CA4 g_defGameForm      # form passed to dm_showForm / dm_getFormResult
10D4 g_wordsPerGameText # " 4" -- text of the Words per Game field (atoi'd on OK)
10D8 g_wrongGuessText   # " 7" -- text of the Wrong Guesses field
22D2 g_dlgSaveArea      # passed to dm_openDialogEx / dm_closeDialog (screen save?)
ADEE g_numPlayers       # word: players chosen in Define Game (radio index + 1)
AE44 g_wordsPerGame     # word
AE46 g_maxWrongGuesses  # word
